  "content_blocks": [
    {
      "block_id": "b00000",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Competitive dialogue",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "heading_path": [
        "Competitive dialogue"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In: Procure > Clarification and due diligence",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [
        "Competitive dialogue"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Overview",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [
        "Competitive dialogue",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This regulation sets out the rules that apply to competitive dialogue procurement procedures, including the rules in relation to minimum timescales for requests to participate.",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [
        "Competitive dialogue",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "A contracting authority may only award a contract following the competitive dialogue procedure on the basis of the best price-quality ratio.",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "Competitive dialogue",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The authority may discuss all aspects of the procurement with the chosen suppliers during the dialogue but must ensure that suppliers are treated equally.",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "Competitive dialogue",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The regulation also states that a competitive dialogue procedure may take place in successive stages in order to reduce the number of solutions to be discussed.",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Competitive dialogue",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Before assessing the final tenders, the contracting authority may request a supplier to clarify, specify and / or optimise its final tender, subject to certain conditions.",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "Competitive dialogue",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Once the contracting authority has identified the tenderer who submitted the final tender with the best price-quality ratio, then the contracting authority may request negotiations with the successful supplier to confirm financial commitments or other terms contained in the successful supplier’s final tender by finalising the terms of the contract, again subject to certain conditions.",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "Competitive dialogue",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Objective at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "Competitive dialogue",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Conduct the dialogue stage with a view to identifying the solution or solutions which are most capable of meeting the contracting authority’s needs.",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "Competitive dialogue",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Key considerations at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "Competitive dialogue",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Contracting authorities should:",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [
        "Competitive dialogue",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "ensure that the dialogue stage aims to identify and define the means best suited to satisfying the contracting authority’s needs",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [
        "Competitive dialogue",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00014",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "discuss all aspects of the procurement with the chosen suppliers during the dialogue provided that all suppliers are treated equally",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "heading_path": [
        "Competitive dialogue",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00015",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "not reveal to the other suppliers in the dialogue other solutions or information, unless the relevant supplier agrees to the intended communication of the specific information",
      "ordinal": 15,
      "heading_path": [
        "Competitive dialogue",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00016",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "continue the dialogue process until it can identify one or more solutions which are capable of meeting its needs",
      "ordinal": 16,
      "heading_path": [
        "Competitive dialogue",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00017",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "declare the conclusion of the dialogue stage before inviting suppliers to submit their final tenders",
      "ordinal": 17,
      "heading_path": [
        "Competitive dialogue",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00018",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "carry out sufficient due diligence to verify the deliverability and compliance of final tender submissions.",
      "ordinal": 18,
      "heading_path": [
        "Competitive dialogue",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00019",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Legal framework",
      "ordinal": 19,
      "heading_path": [
        "Competitive dialogue",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00020",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "See also in the Procurement Act 2023:",
      "ordinal": 20,
      "heading_path": [
        "Competitive dialogue",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00021",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Section 20: Competitive tendering procedures",
      "ordinal": 21,
      "heading_path": [
        "Competitive dialogue",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00022",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Section 54: Time limits",
      "ordinal": 22,
      "heading_path": [
        "Competitive dialogue",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00023",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Additional support and guidance",
      "ordinal": 23,
      "heading_path": [
        "Competitive dialogue",
        "Additional support and guidance"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00024",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Make sure you:",
      "ordinal": 24,
      "heading_path": [
        "Competitive dialogue",
        "Additional support and guidance"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00025",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "read the regulation",
      "ordinal": 25,
      "heading_path": [
        "Competitive dialogue",
        "Additional support and guidance"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00026",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "seek legal and commercial advice in the context of specific procurements",
      "ordinal": 26,
      "heading_path": [
        "Competitive dialogue",
        "Additional support and guidance"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
